  m_Name: TheColdStones
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: thecoldstones
  displayName: The Cold Stones
  description: The portal has something to tell you about the old stones out past the meadows. Hear it out, then light one.
  chain: The Haven's Reach
  journalNotes: 'The portal has felt how far your fire reaches. Out past the meadows each of the old lands has a boundary stone that once burned from this hearth.


    A stone doesn''t know you until you have found one of the places in its land: walk up to one and it goes on your map ({key:WorldMap}). The stone tells you which way the nearest lies. The first stone you light needs nothing but your hand; the rest want a Pact Rune.


    The Haven window''s Lands tab ({key:Haven}) lists every region, what it is like and what it would give.


    The Grey Pines'' stone, about 260 m north-west past the Charcoal Camp, is the nearest to the first walks out.'
